  "change_explanation": "Publishes the owner-accepted placement of the chapter's court acts: one new place record for the court's seat (平城宮, the palace of 平城京) and corrected revisions of the ten events whose entries name no place (or name 内裏). Each act is anchored at the palace as a display anchor; no coordinate is asserted, and the palace's attestation and the modern site's coordinate are cited on the place record. The owner accepted this recommendation on 2026-09-24; it is a decision to publish this content, not the owner's editorial approval under RFD 2, and the specialist reviews remain outstanding. The revisions and pins published by lks:set:tang-mission-750-754-v1 and lks:set:tang-mission-750-754-v2 stay in the tree unchanged.",
